<title>SOUTH KOREA: Doosan Beverage '96 net up 66.7 percent.</title>
<headline>Doosan Beverage '96 net up 66.7 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion unless stated)</p>
<p>    Share (won)	   1,972	vs     1,316</p>
<p>    Net			   3.5    vs	   2.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		  397.8    vs	 300.1</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	 6.5    vs	   3.1</p>
<p>    Extraordinary  (gain)  22.3    vs (loss)  0.2</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, in cash, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>	   common stocks     15.0    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>	   preferred stocks  16.0    vs	  11.0</p>
<p>Note - Doosan Beverage Co absorbed Doosan Foods Co in September. A company official said paid-in capital rose to 24 billion won after the merger from 10 billion.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
